- C-02: privacy consent UI+voice (NeedsConsent, Confirm/Deny, cloud consent cards)
- H-02: classifier dedup - SendPromptUseCase single source of truth
- H-03: AutomationScheduleReceiver goAsync+SupervisorJob+CEH+timeout pattern
- H-04: startServicePipeline isServiceActive guard; ManualWakeWordTrigger via JarvisVoiceService.start
- H-05: removed dead code (AiRetryPolicy, PromptManager, modelOverride, memoryContext, voice/orchestrator/engine)
- H-06: WorkManager bootstrap (AutomationReconcileWorker, KEEP, BOOT_COMPLETED); no sendBroadcast in Application.onCreate
- M-01: JarvisApiHandler parses body ONCE; size check uses UTF-8 byte count
- M-02: AsyncUsageTracker periodic prune of stale zero-count entries
- M-10: SlidingWindowRateLimiter moved to server/test
- Tests: SendPromptUseCasePrivacyGateTest, ChatViewModelPrivacyConsentTest, OutboundPrivacyGuardTest (rewritten), JarvisApiAiClientPrivacyMatrixTest, AsyncUsageTrackerPruneTest, WakeWordExtractorTest, etc.
- CI: scripts/verify-architectural-invariants.sh (32 grep invariants) added to build.yml
- Archive: OrchestratorEngine + ChatUiStateMachine preserved under archive/

